        "type": "writing",
        "title": "Some countries have an ever-increasing proportion of the population who are aged 15 and younger. What is your opinion of the current and future effects it may have in those countries? ",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ORKidGssJoIygNxS8Lol7KNsgxc\"><em><strong>Some countries have an ever-increasing proportion of the population who are aged 15 and younger. What is your opinion of the current and future effects it may have in those countries? </strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NTzNd8mj9oUwbFx0MFilTG8bg97\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 2 - Short-term and long-term effects of young population&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/essay-structure-logical-framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theo Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></a></strong></span></em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> Hiểu đề &amp; viết Introduction:</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Tu0SddWcDoz931xKri8lpq8Wgxh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Đề&nbsp;<em>Short-term and long-term effects of young population </em>cho 1 xu hướng:&nbsp;</strong>Ở một số quốc gia, tỷ lệ d&acirc;n số từ 15 tuổi trở xuống ng&agrave;y c&agrave;ng tăng.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ct2UdtYdhoby7Nxrd2SlZFGAgIf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Dạng c&acirc;u hỏi:</strong> Trả lời 2 phần:&nbsp;<em>T&aacute;c động hiện tại v&agrave; t&aacute;c động trong tương lai của xu hướng n&agrave;y l&agrave; g&igrave;?</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRaBdsLuZoP0rUxH5FWly8vXgUb\">Dựa v&agrave;o đề b&agrave;i <em>Short-term and long-term effects of young population</em>&nbsp;v&agrave; c&acirc;u hỏi, ch&uacute;ng ta c&oacute; thể viết được phần Introduction. Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, phần Introduction lu&ocirc;n c&oacute; 2 c&acirc;u:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RvxLdkWg2o1TemxUMSJlS50eguh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 1: </strong>Paraphrase đề b&agrave;i</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TS3PdFFE4ooFjlx0jselldGTgEe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 2: </strong>Thesis statement - Trả lời c&acirc;u hỏi</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O66RdEdiuoAwdBxsDMPlxpn0gCd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RQSlddEvOoG6VVxAXT3lJrsjg38\" data-list=\"bullet\">the proportion of the population aged 15 and under <em>(tỷ lệ d&acirc;n số từ 15 tuổi trở xuống)</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RQSlddEvOoG6VVxAXT3lJrsjg38\" data-list=\"bullet\">on the rise&nbsp;<em>(đang gia tăng)</em></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AUxLdwnbKof5AxxE7qFlhlHMgTg\">\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; lập luận &amp; ph&acirc;n BODY:</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pklmddy9Bo7tzyxz8N8lq70Dgyb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FpNbd7IdBoA4Ctx6gxsl4JN5gie\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OWsUdfdiSo5zJSxHBAElqPqPgMf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DnoWda9NLoogFOxHQgvljDWwgQI\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y0VTdv3RjoVBMUxyY6glDwkugHc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xxw3dzwzloLfvMx31Ozl4U5Rgdd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GNJ6d5ipHoc8XKxmUm7lK2WGgfe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IbjJdoy4ooQvOuxYcF4lOk6kgMf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Sukddc77loPsMxxLtyKlkqdYgFb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C7yrdcTO5oqFcXxj2eulMHpUgdc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JsabdjYrpoeNLgx2I7glvIXKgfe\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, đối với dạng c&oacute; <strong>hai c&acirc;u hỏi độc lập</strong>, th&igrave; ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ lần lượt trả lời từng c&acirc;u hỏi trong mỗi BODY như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NHondlQHQoSvFwxo2qRljImZgOe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 1:</strong> Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y v&agrave; ph&acirc;n t&iacute;ch c&aacute;c t&aacute;c động hiện tại của việc tỷ lệ d&acirc;n số trẻ ng&agrave;y c&agrave;ng tăng</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-W3xqd9C33ot9ZExvD6el2ifBgnd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 2: </strong>Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y v&agrave; ph&acirc;n t&iacute;ch c&aacute;c t&aacute;c động trong tương lai của xu hướng n&agrave;y</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HEkZdVl0Loexrnx8bSzlHBRBg3D\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E6xsduRXyo7PgoxfRdNlJsyWgCb\"><em>(*) Nếu bạn chưa nắm vững về cấu tr&uacute;c đoạn văn v&agrave; logic ph&aacute;t triển &yacute; theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>th&igrave; bạn h&atilde;y xem c&aacute;c b&agrave;i học sau trước khi viết b&agrave;i theo gợi &yacute; ở bước 3 nh&eacute;:</em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZCi8dUtrIoNNTTx7gl3llDpYgUL\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/cau-truc-doan-van\" target=\"_self\">Logic sắp xếp th&ocirc;ng tin trong paragraph</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jvy7dry7XoJRCyx1bgulj2smgZf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-reason-impact\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Reason v&agrave; Impact</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DqjpdMqWWoiZ5lxsEK7lpzBagSh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-example\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Example</a></strong></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h2 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 1: Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y v&agrave; ph&acirc;n t&iacute;ch c&aacute;c t&aacute;c động hiện tại của việc tỷ lệ d&acirc;n số trẻ ng&agrave;y c&agrave;ng tăng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kk5gd8w6foneJkxtmd7ld1C4grP\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OTuvdKP8xofWPhxe3dnljyPXgvd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GGx2dtMsVo2SRMxTaHOlDGY0gIh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OUsndgv96oXwDFxW1FrloHVrgAe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GRTBdEWugofGoixOPJblvMOygNU\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CqPEd28cco0ycmxZHuQlljkHgMe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T4nldWXyRoUmvgxl7nOldzdAgIf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CizadgB9moHAc1xIKRIlK0EVgAz\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TYRIdhFgWoNmKuxEEpklKyzbgMh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RoD7dJ6YFoa0rLxlxj1l11v0gwo\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F5tQdQOeaoe8mMxQ5UklAxSJgNh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WhKydTGIuoxZ05xYIxWlZPqbgTh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence:&nbsp;</strong></span>Hiện nay, sự gia tăng nhanh ch&oacute;ng của d&acirc;n số trẻ đang tạo ra &aacute;p lực đ&aacute;ng kể l&ecirc;n hai lĩnh vực c&ocirc;ng thiết yếu: gi&aacute;o dục v&agrave; y tế.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WhKydTGIuoxZ05xYIxWlZPqbgTh\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B7iId6hhwoyuHZxjXJ5l19sfgKd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JAgHdsdjDohJbvxNORLlgQBqg7c\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core Idea:&nbsp;</strong>Trước hết, đối với gi&aacute;o dục, khi ng&agrave;y c&agrave;ng c&oacute; nhiều trẻ em <em>nhập học (enroll in schools)</em>, c&aacute;c lớp học trở n&ecirc;n qu&aacute; tải v&agrave; gi&aacute;o vi&ecirc;n buộc phải phụ tr&aacute;ch số lượng học sinh đ&ocirc;ng hơn</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZexDdV8ppoE82kxisQPlQ71Ag0e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact:&nbsp;</strong>Hệ quả l&agrave; mỗi học sinh <em>nhận được &iacute;t sự quan t&acirc;m (receives less individual attention)</em> hơn từ gi&aacute;o vi&ecirc;n, điều n&agrave;y <em>l&agrave;m suy giảm chất lượng gi&aacute;o dục (causes the quality of education to decline)</em> v&agrave; khiến c&aacute;c em gặp kh&oacute; khăn trong việc ph&aacute;t triển những kỹ năng cần thiết cho sự nghiệp sau n&agrave;y</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XrwCd0yJMo0jNUxFNvNlWLcfg1e\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2: </strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Vs9bdaafkoRCYVxqvhOlBBh7gLe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core Idea:</strong> Về mặt y tế, d&acirc;n số trẻ gia tăng cũng <em>k&eacute;o theo nhu cầu cao hơn đối với c&aacute;c dịch vụ chăm s&oacute;c sức khỏe nhi khoa (leads to a greater demand for pediatric medical services)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BZXVdOwYboLow7xjqDRlYMmVgBc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Reason + Impact: </strong>C&aacute;c bệnh viện v&agrave; ph&ograve;ng kh&aacute;m, đặc biệt l&agrave; ở khu vực n&ocirc;ng th&ocirc;n, đang rơi v&agrave;o t&igrave;nh trạng qu&aacute; tải bệnh nh&acirc;n, dẫn đến thời gian chờ đợi k&eacute;o d&agrave;i. Điều n&agrave;y đồng nghĩa với việc nhiều trẻ em <em>c&oacute; thể kh&ocirc;ng được điều trị kịp thời (may not receive timely medical treatment)</em>, từ đ&oacute; <em>tiềm ẩn những rủi ro nghi&ecirc;m trọng đối với sức khỏe v&agrave; sự ph&aacute;t triển to&agrave;n diện của c&aacute;c em về l&acirc;u d&agrave;i (pose serious risks to their overall health and development in the long run)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 2: Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y v&agrave; ph&acirc;n t&iacute;ch c&aacute;c t&aacute;c động trong tương lai của xu hướng n&agrave;y</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KrtVdtupRoKL6sxjDB2lsqewgkf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IpmcdM2KVo20yvx1AcclbEoFgNe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WdeNdWsDkoHkxfxFq99lekOpgte\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Zq8Ed5ZPxoJixmxjWwPlsAd9gQ8\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q9QVdRGxLozW5JxLNrOlZt4TgTh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ec7GdL8hOopk25xWQG2llrpWgfd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S88bdXvGSorowHxwaxulSLSbgsh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CjagdHbLyoowjwxYEW4l2Quigug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CjagdHbLyoowjwxYEW4l2Quigug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IMDNd3MH4oKzDpxutSSl4mMegvh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Sw7Nd7yYpoSL3kxZzWXl77tKgdX\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence: </strong></span>Trong tương lai, <em>xu hướng nh&acirc;n khẩu học (demographic trend)</em> n&agrave;y c&oacute; thể mang lại cả t&aacute;c động t&iacute;ch cực lẫn ti&ecirc;u cực.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Sw7Nd7yYpoSL3kxZzWXl77tKgdX\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PhRSdel6LoOHtWxhOaHllMpKg9d\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I0XddwQJBoLl6YxsgWvlneqvgue\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core Idea:</strong> Ở kh&iacute;a cạnh t&iacute;ch cực, lực lượng d&acirc;n số trẻ đ&ocirc;ng đảo hiện nay sẽ dần trở th&agrave;nh <em>một nguồn lao động dồi d&agrave;o (a massive labor force)</em> trong những thập kỷ tới</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T7izdK6wjo64yOxA6F6lS0Y6gLb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Example:&nbsp;</strong>Khi c&oacute; nhiều <em>người trong độ tuổi lao động (working-age individuals)</em> đ&oacute;ng g&oacute;p cho c&aacute;c ng&agrave;nh kinh tế kh&aacute;c nhau, <em>năng suất quốc gia (national productivity)</em> c&oacute; thể tăng l&ecirc;n đ&aacute;ng kể, qua đ&oacute; gi&uacute;p c&aacute;c quốc gia <em>đạt được tăng trưởng kinh tế bền vững (achieve sustainable economic growth)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OKdBd2jDColbB2xUgeJl0rQMgNe\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RzLPd2a0toBjxZx1fA6luq2ngfd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core Idea:&nbsp;</strong>Tuy nhi&ecirc;n, nếu qu&aacute; nhiều người trẻ c&ugrave;ng l&uacute;c gia nhập thị trường lao động, điều đ&oacute; c&oacute; thể dẫn đến <em>sự cạnh tranh gay gắt trong việc t&igrave;m kiếm việc l&agrave;m (fierce competition for employment)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RzLPd2a0toBjxZx1fA6luq2ngfd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Example: </strong>Nhiều người c&oacute; thể gặp kh&oacute; khăn trong việc t&igrave;m được c&ocirc;ng việc ổn định, v&agrave; khi <em>thiếu nguồn thu nhập đ&aacute;ng tin cậy (without a reliable source of income)</em>, họ c&oacute; nguy cơ <em>rơi v&agrave;o cảnh ngh&egrave;o đ&oacute;i (fall into poverty)</em>.&nbsp;T&igrave;nh trạng n&agrave;y c&oacute; thể <em>k&eacute;o theo nhiều vấn đề x&atilde; hội kh&aacute;c như tội phạm v&agrave; bất b&igrave;nh đẳng gia tăng (give rise to various social issues such as crime and inequality)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Viết Conclusion:</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkOnd9VeToRuWPxTqkUlIuw9gif\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jx3IdxsyToocMyxrcHBlR5M4gTb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z215dilK9oetfOxPDFol02JKgkg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JRbGdLxfwoyo3LxfaWvlKYZxgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S41gdx1Yho0RQhxH1Zclco4KgPH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MDkodyWDGo2nbTx3llNlDkiTgye\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bx6adWi8AoLDF0xo9FAl8FSSgig\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y8TJdaqR0oT0n0xPP4JlvEIWg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QOh0dpvFwodYoYxAfXPlC5RmgbG\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YUnRdmwHoomd0bx3B9xl3s1Agte\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YvCFdQxWsoceFLxYDv4lsxKqg2d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bạn h&atilde;y viết Conclusion bằng c&aacute;ch <strong>t&oacute;m tắt lại ngắn gọn c&aacute;c &yacute; đ&atilde; được thảo luận trong 2 đoạn BODY nh&eacute;.</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YvCFdQxWsoceFLxYDv4lsxKqg2d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X2nCdFhyUoQul9xqlgXlr4PKgvb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ee4Jdw1TOosZpRxGDvJlAJHVgyb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">puts a strain on education and healthcare systems&nbsp;<em>(g&acirc;y &aacute;p lực lớn l&ecirc;n hệ thống gi&aacute;o dục v&agrave; y tế)</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ee4Jdw1TOosZpRxGDvJlAJHVgyb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">fuel future economic development&nbsp;<em>(th&uacute;c đẩy ph&aacute;t triển kinh tế)</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ee4Jdw1TOosZpRxGDvJlAJHVgyb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">heightened unemployment and social instability&nbsp;<em>(nạn thất nghiệp v&agrave; bất ổn x&atilde; hội tăng cao)</em></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 3534,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P81NdJjBloPeiJxQTQKliQQngWg\">In several nations around the world, the proportion of the population aged 15 and under is on the rise. This essay will discuss the effects that this trend is currently having and may continue to have in the future, both of which I believe are significant.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 44076,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 3535,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<p><strong>At present, the growing number of young people is placing considerable pressure on two essential public sectors: education and healthcare.</strong> <span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\">Regarding the former, as more children enroll in schools, classrooms become increasingly overcrowded, and teachers are forced to handle a larger number of students. As a result, each student receives less individual attention from their teachers, which causes the quality of education to decline and makes it harder for young learners to develop the essential skills they need for their future careers. </span><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">As for healthcare, the rising young population also leads to a greater demand for pediatric medical services. Hospitals and clinics, especially those in rural areas, are becoming overwhelmed with patients, resulting in longer waiting times. This means that many children may not receive timely medical treatment, which could pose serious risks to their overall health and development in the long run.</span></p>",
            "question_id": 44076,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 3536,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<p><strong>Looking ahead, this demographic trend is likely to bring about both positive and negative consequences. </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\">On the positive side, today's large young population will eventually become a massive labor force in the coming decades. With more working-age individuals contributing to various industries, national productivity could increase significantly, thereby helping these countries achieve sustainable economic growth.</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">On the other hand, having too many young people entering the job market at the same time could lead to fierce competition for employment. Many of them may struggle to find stable jobs, and without a reliable source of income, these individuals could fall into poverty, which in turn may give rise to various social issues such as crime and inequality.</span></p>",
            "question_id": 44076,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 3537,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Conclusion",
            "value": "<p>In conclusion, the ever-increasing proportion of young people currently puts a strain on education and healthcare systems. While this trend may fuel future economic development through a larger workforce, it also carries the risk of heightened unemployment and social instability.</p>",
